msgctxt "Addons::name::sg_quotation"
msgid "Ecartify: Advanced RFQ Manager"
msgstr "Ecartify: Advanced RFQ Manager"

msgctxt "Addons::description::sg_quotation"
msgid "Transform your CS-Cart store into a B2B powerhouse with Ecartify: Request Quotation. Customers request custom quotes directly from product pages or bulk order forms, admins review and apply tailored discounts (percentage or fixed), and approved quotations convert to orders through automated checkout links. Complete with email notifications at every step, centralized request management, and full quotation tracking, this addon turns complex wholesale negotiations into smooth, professional transactions. Perfect for businesses serving bulk buyers, corporate clients, and wholesale customers who demand flexible pricing and personalized service."
msgstr "Transform your CS-Cart store into a B2B powerhouse with Ecartify: Request Quotation. Customers request custom quotes directly from product pages or bulk order forms, admins review and apply tailored discounts (percentage or fixed), and approved quotations convert to orders through automated checkout links. Complete with email notifications at every step, centralized request management, and full quotation tracking, this addon turns complex wholesale negotiations into smooth, professional transactions. Perfect for businesses serving bulk buyers, corporate clients, and wholesale customers who demand flexible pricing and personalized service."

